  "summary": "Execution-planning layer that prepares and runs relation plans across locations without materializing during planning. LocationResolver resolves each node's ExecutionLocation, prepare_execution builds an occurrence-based placement and transfer recipe (PreparedExecution), CompilationSession reuses one recipe and transport scope for all native subtrees, TransportSession performs declared operand transfers with owned-resource lifetime, and capabilities.py runs AST-known capability gates shared by preflight and dispatch.",
